      "side": 1,
      "message": "Skimming it this looks fine but I won\u0027t have time to look at it thoroughly before I go. What\u0027s the justification for using the Recorder now since we were trying to avoid it before?",
      "revId": "e618e222d3f0386b848c2fbf47db4349f87177ec",
