      "writtenOn": "2024-05-20T17:21:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I assume this also means that we will snap off the Recording internally and submit it. Thus that means if a client had previously Recorded work they will lose the chance to hold onto that work in a Recording. If this is all true this needs to be careful spelled out here for clients and most likely suggested that they snap off a Recording before calling this function.",
