      "writtenOn": "2024-05-20T17:39:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, these are privately created Recorders that the Context creates if it determines that drawing is necessary to do part of the async readback. It used to be that each internal async readback function was responsible for snapping a Recording and inserting it (if their logic triggered draws) before calling finalize. Now the recorder moves with the calls into finalize() and if it\u0027s not null it\u0027s snapped and inserted in just that one place. Logically the tasks are all still ordered the same as before relative to the finish info, but it\u0027s consolidated.",
      "parentUuid": "adbab0e5_aa06e622",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 244,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 244,
        "endChar": 15
      },
